OL,3,GNEWSAGroup makes formal complaint over
OL,4,Astadium plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign group opposing plans for a
OL,7,F16,000-seater football stadium has made
OL,8,Fa formal complaint over the lack of
OL,9,Fprotection given to a local woodland.
OL,11,FThe Friends of Stratfield Brake (FoSB)
OL,12,Fsaid Natural England had twice
OL,13,Fidentified woodland at The Triangle,
OL,14,Fnear Kidlington, as "ancient", but
OL,15,Fwithdrew the status over "reputational
OL,16,Fconcerns" and "political interference".
OL,18,FOxford United was awarded planning
OL,19,Fpermission for a new stadium on the
OL,20,Fsite last year, but the final decision
OL,21,Fis still subject to an appeal.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
